<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2095" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄθως</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ω</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, δ</span>, acc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄθω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.132
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.77
			</span></i>, etc., but in earlier writers <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄθων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.3
			</span></i>: 
				Ep.
			 gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθόω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.229
				</span></i>
			; later gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄθωος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			:—<i>mount Athos</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄθως σκιάζει νῶτα Αημνίας βοός</span> (prov. of
			those whose influence is felt at a distance, from the shadow cast by
			Athos) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				776
			</span></i>.</div>
